5.1. The User must:
• use the platform only for lawful purposes;
• not infringe the rights of third parties while using the platform;
• not attempt unauthorized access to other users' data;
• comply with applicable data protection law.

5.2. The Company must:
• maintain platform availability of at least 99.9% per month;
• give at least 24 hours' notice of scheduled maintenance;
• store User data in accordance with the Privacy Policy.
